			"identifier": "Switch",
			"uid": 4051,
			"tags": [],
			"exportToToc": false,
			"allowOutOfBounds": true,
			"doc": "Latched player-facing switch. Persists in the sandbox save by `id`. The `target_encounter` + `action` fields tell the runtime what to do on activation; the only `action` recognized today is `ResetEncounter`, which clears the matching encounter's defeat state and returns it to a fresh-attempt state. ",
